        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Alex Wyse\n- Products: Marvel's Iron Fist, The Bold and the Beautiful, Spring Awakening, The Defenders\n- Concepts: Marvel Cinematic Universe\n\nFacts:\n- In 2015, Alex Wyse played Georg Zirschnitz in the Deaf West Broadway revival of Spring Awakening.\n- Alex Wyse is best known for playing Kyle in Marvel's Iron Fist.\n- Alex Wyse is best known for playing Saul Feinberg in The Bold and the Beautiful.\n- Marvel's Iron Fist is set in the Marvel Cinematic Universe.\n- Marvel's Iron Fist shares continuity with the films of the Marvel Cinematic Universe franchise.\n- Marvel's Iron Fist is the fourth in a series of shows that lead to The Defenders crossover miniseries.",
